{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>Yissa</b> — corresponding to Jacob: וישא יעקב רגליו. And it is written of him ושבתי בשלום. It has 7 words, corresponding to the tribes that were born, most of them within 7 years. And 25 letters, corresponding to כה תאמר לבית יעקב." "<b>Vi-yasem</b> — it has 7 tagin, for בז' דרכים ישם לך שלום, on the basis of בז' דרכים ינוסו לפניך." "<b>Shalom</b> — in gematria עשו. To hint: be one who initiates shalom to every person, and even to an Esau, an alien."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:18.395436242Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}